+"""
+Lightweight transport demand forecasting and staff reallocation helper.
+ - Provides /predict to get short-term demand prediction per stop/venue.
+ - Provides /reallocate to suggest staff reallocation actions.
+ - Example placeholder model: rolling average of recent counts.
+"""
